<p>Sharp shards of stone grow from your shields.</p><p>When you are hit in melee, you will get a free attack against the attacker with the shards doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100%</acronym> shield damage (as Nature).</p><p>This effect can only happen once per turn and is not affected by counterstrike.</p>